.TH ROM-HAMSTER 1 "2026-11-17" "rom-hamster 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rom-hamster \- manage a local ROM library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rom-hamster
[\fIOPTION\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rom-hamster
imports, classifies and queries a local ROM library stored in a single SQLite
file. It does not download ROMs and does not convert ROM formats.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the program version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print usage information and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/rom-hamster/rom-hamster.conf
System-wide configuration.
.TP
.I /usr/share/rom-hamster/platforms.conf
Factory platform rules (read only).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rom-hamster-gui (1)
